* dc Vref 3.3 1.5 -0.1
DC TEMP -30 125 1
**write dc.raw
PLOT V(vbias)
**PLOT I(VIOUT1)
** PLOT @n.xbgrtop.xmnsu1.nsg13_hv_nmos[ids]
**PLOT @n.xbgrtop.xmnsu2.nsg13_hv_nmos[ids]
